# Environment variables for the capstone-prompt-injection project.
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# Each key is required by a specific part of the pipeline. The notes below
# indicate which scripts or modules need each key.

# Anthropic API key. Required for the Claude family judges in Defense B.
# Used by: src/defense_b/judge.py
#   - ClaudeJudge: Sonnet 4.6 (primary v1.21 judge) and Opus 4.7 (v1.25
#     cost-ceiling test). Pass `model="claude-opus-4-7"` to ClaudeJudge for
#     Opus runs; default model is Sonnet 4.6.
#   - HaikuJudge: Haiku 4.5 (the production-recommended judge under v1.25 per
#     final report §6.3 / §7.4; reaches kappa 0.554 on the 150-row gold subset,
#     statistically tied with Opus 4.7 at 5x less cost).
# Used by: scripts/rejudge_v125_gold_subset.py for the v1.25 + Opus rerun on
# the 150-row gold subset.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# OpenAI API key. Required for the GPT-4o sensitivity-check judge and for
# the GPT-4o-mini cost-comparison judge in the cheap-judge sweep.
# Used by: src/defense_b/judge.py (GPT4oJudge class).
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Groq API key. HISTORICAL: required only for the Phase 1 sneak-preview
# Defense B agent runs on Llama 3.3 70B Versatile (24 hardest cases across
# deepset role-play, neuralchemy jailbreak, neuralchemy encoding). The free /
# on-demand tier daily quota was exhausted mid-project; subsequent agent work
# moved to Together AI's Llama 3.3 70B Instruct Turbo. This key is no longer
# required to reproduce the headline results; kept here for reproducibility
# of the sneak-preview artifacts (`results/defense_b_sneak_preview.md` and
# the two neuralchemy preview docs).
# Used by: src/defense_b/agent.py (GroqAgent class).
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Together AI API key. Required for the production Defense B agent: the
# Together-hosted Llama 3.3 70B Instruct Turbo model. Used at the 500-row
# Defense B pilot scale (§5.5b headline measurement) and at 800-row BIPIA
# scale (§5.8). Pay-as-you-go pricing, no daily quota.
# Used by: src/defense_b/agent.py (TogetherAgent class).
TOGETHER_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter API key. Required for the Mistral Large 2 and DeepSeek V3
# agents used in the cross-family stretch-goal evaluation (§5.5b cross-family
# extension and §5.8 BIPIA cross-family). OpenRouter is a meta-provider
# hosting many model APIs behind one OpenAI-compatible endpoint, used here
# for models that Together AI does not offer serverless (Mistral and
# DeepSeek 70B+ tier). NOTE: OpenRouter's multi-provider failover routing
# had reliability issues on structured tool-call output during the §5.9
# AgentDojo evaluation; for tool-using agents prefer Together AI dedicated
# endpoints.
# Used by: src/defense_b/agent.py (OpenRouterAgent class).
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# HuggingFace access token. Required to download the gated Meta Prompt Guard 2
# model (Defense A second classifier; both 86M and 22M variants). Not required
# for ProtectAI DeBERTa-v3-prompt-injection-v2, which is public.
# Also required for the NB10 series LoRA fine-tunes if you want to push the
# trained adapters back to the HuggingFace Hub; not required if adapters stay
# on Google Drive (which is the current setup).
# Used by: src/defense_a/prompt_guard.py; optionally by the NB10 notebooks on
# Colab if HF Hub push is enabled.
HF_TOKEN=
